# Keep the real samples byte for byte: Work-FB is UTF-16LE with a BOM, Autoshop-FB is GB18030 with CRLF line endings.
# Git detects both as binary on its own today; the explicit -text pins that down so that no end-of-line normalisation can ever apply
# (the workspace default is * text=auto eol=lf and Git for Windows sets core.autocrlf=true).
*.csv -text -diff
